-- NOT RUN. Run in Supabase Dashboard -> SQL Editor, after 20261110_curriculum.sql (the five curriculum tables); the Environmental Activities grades in order, 1 to 3 (prerequisites name the grade below or pre-primary readiness skills, ENVI.PP2.READINESS.*, defined by HOREB in g1.json under readiness, not rows of curriculum_skills; there is no foreign key on them). Idempotent: safe to run twice.
-- WHY: Environmental Activities Grade 1 had KICD outcomes only (curriculum/environmental_activities/g1.json); on 19 Nov 2026 it was mapped to the Grade 5 Maths standard (a skill for every testable outcome, practical outcomes to the teacher's KICD rubric, two or more prerequisites and four misconceptions per skill, a teaching pack). This loads 16 skills (proposed), 33 prerequisites (proposed) and 64 misconceptions (draft)
-- for 11 of 11 sub-strands, for the teacher reviewer. Outcomes are KICD's own words and are not changed.
-- GENERATED by scripts/build-environmental-grade.mjs 1 from curriculum/environmental_activities/g1.json. Do not edit by hand.
-- The sub-strands and outcomes are inserted first (do nothing if present) so the foreign keys hold.
-- =====================================================================
BEGIN;
DELETE FROM public.curriculum_prerequisites WHERE skill_code LIKE 'ENVI.G1.%' AND requires_kind = 'outcome' AND status = 'proposed';
COMMIT;
